<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS - Australia's QTC 2007 bond yields 8.076 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS - Australia's QTC 2007 bond yields 8.076 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Queensland Treasury Corporation (QTC) said on Thursday the tender of its 8.0 percent September 2007 stock produced an weighted average yield (WAY) of 8.076 percent.</p>
<p> OFFERED A$100 MLN     COUPON   8.0 PCT     MATURITY  14.09.07</p>
<p> TYPE    SEMI/GOVT     WAY	8.076	 SETT DATE 24.09.96</p>
<p> ALLOTTED A$100 MLN    RANGE    8.065-8.08</p>
<p>QTC, the central borrowing authority for the state of Queensland, said this is the first time that this stock has been tendered since being established in March.</p>
<p>--Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
